    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear To Survive is a PVE Survival Extraction Shooter.<br>Explore the world in a post-apocalyptic America.<br>A very rare resource has been discovered in America, this resource is going to be used to make super conductors. Unable to effectively mine it they outsource engineering to experts in Germany. This... is where things go bad! They make the machines turn these resources into a gas that has mutated majority of America to move in when the gas dissipates and take the resources for themselves.<br><br>Go out find materials and loot. Bring this loot back to your compound to upgrade and unlock more locations. Find survivors in the world to complete quests for.\u00a0</p>",
